{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Explodes multi-take items so each take gets its own dedicated track. Works on all selected items. For each selected item with N takes:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab The active take goes on the original track (track renamed to take name)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab All other takes get new tracks inserted below, also named after the take\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab The original multi-take item is deleted after all single-take items are created Undo point is created automatically.\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
